      "text": "to as the Panel).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        234.90423583984375,
        513.4721069335938,
        248.2557373046875
      ],
      "text": "Stephen Graham (University of Melbourne, Melbourne, Australia, and International",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        250.9007568359375,
        513.471923828125,
        264.25225830078125
      ],
      "text": "Union Against Tuberculosis and Lung Disease, Paris, France) led the team that compiled,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        266.89727783203125,
        513.4029541015625,
        280.248779296875
      ],
      "text": "synthesized and evaluated the evidence underlying the recent recommendations that",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        282.893798828125,
        271.0058288574219,
        296.24530029296875
