      "text": "were considered for possible revision.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        307.40032958984375,
        387.6963806152344,
        320.7518310546875
      ],
      "text": "Suzanne Hill chaired and facilitated the meeting of the Panel.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        331.9068298339844,
        513.4144897460938,
        345.2583312988281
      ],
      "text": "Technical advice relating to drug dosages was provided by Professor Peter Donald",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        347.9033203125,
        513.4490966796875,
        361.25482177734375
