      "text": "(Children’s Mercy Hospitals and Clinics, Kansas City, MO, USA).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        388.40631103515625,
        513.4260864257812,
        401.7578125
